      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the air fryer basket with parchment paper. Spray parchment paper with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8n_rQp9b-NNWRrSpfSvJoKFvKJc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/270828-Air-Fryer-oreos-DDMFS-Step1-2612-efc434a5ae874037b0b67784537e9eab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270828/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix pancake mix and water together in a bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip each cookie into pancake mixture and place in the prepared basket, making sure they are not touching; cook in batches if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y1YM_RSKviU3xYx9_NSiT45vm_4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/270828-Air-Fryer-oreos-DDMFS-Step2-2614-f039eecb85a640bb95af084377af9eb7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270828/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer for 4 to 5 minutes; flip cookies and cook until golden brown, 2 to 3 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ApR5E43Fa91X9HXFAhS04XUt2FY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/270828-Air-Fryer-oreos-DDMFS-Step3-2615-8f625b7371c044b8ad52132758b43748.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/270828/step_05.webp"
